+<div class="wrap">
+  <div class="eyebrow">C4 · Level 3</div>
+  <h1>Components</h1>
+  <p class="lede">Forty-four components across six planes. Click any one for its contract — what it reads, what it produces, and what it is waiting on.</p>
+
+  <div class="legend">
+    <span><span class="comp-dot d-ok"></span> specified</span>
+    <span><span class="comp-dot d-warn"></span> assumed</span>
+    <span><span class="comp-dot d-stop"></span> blocked</span>
